529
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:18,980
What is this?

530
00:21:20,380 --> 00:21:22,150
Are you worried it made a scratch? Hold on.

531
00:21:22,990 --> 00:21:24,020
Hold on.

532
00:21:24,250 --> 00:21:26,060
