533
00:21:26,860 --> 00:21:27,990
That's incredible.

534
00:21:29,530 --> 00:21:30,630
Sorry. Oh, my.

535
00:21:31,930 --> 00:21:33,300
I didn't close it after seeing your bag...

536
00:21:33,300 --> 00:21:34,730
He saw my bag, then...

537
00:21:34,930 --> 00:21:36,070
(On this no-consideration trip,)

538
00:21:36,070 --> 00:21:37,270
(you have to get your own bag.)

539
00:21:37,270 --> 00:21:38,670
I thought it was a tool bag for the car.

540
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,970
We're both individualists...

541
00:21:41,770 --> 00:21:44,370
(Even Joon thinks this situation is funny.)

542
00:21:44,370 --> 00:21:45,480
So funny.

543
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:47,580
Sleep well.

544
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:49,680
- Bye.
- Bye.

545
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:51,450
(Saying goodnight, looking forward to the next day)

546
00:21:53,550 --> 00:21:59,490
(Only the lights stay up, painting the quiet night.)

547
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:05,400
