548
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:06,630
Morning in Calgary.

549
00:22:07,300 --> 00:22:08,400
Oh, it's cold.

550
00:22:08,570 --> 00:22:10,630
The temperature differences are quite drastic.

551
00:22:11,070 --> 00:22:12,670
It was warm yesterday afternoon.

552
00:22:12,670 --> 00:22:13,840
It's a bit chilly, right?

553
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:16,910
(People are already wearing warmer clothes.)

554
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:20,780
