555
00:22:21,780 --> 00:22:23,550
Who's driving? You, Hyun Moo?

556
00:22:24,150 --> 00:22:26,620
- Should I try driving today?
- Go ahead.

557
00:22:26,850 --> 00:22:28,450
Joon likes to drive.

558
00:22:29,690 --> 00:22:30,690
(Groaning)

559
00:22:30,950 --> 00:22:31,960
(Groaning)

560
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:35,060
(Even their groaning is similar.)

561
00:22:35,390 --> 00:22:37,130
This car is so big. I'm scared.

562
00:22:37,130 --> 00:22:38,700
You haven't driven a car like this, I see.

563
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:40,700
I drive buses, though.

564
00:22:40,930 --> 00:22:42,670
- Really?
- I have a bus driving license.

565
00:22:42,670 --> 00:22:44,370
- Do you have one?
- Yes, I have one.

566
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:46,870
So I'm good at covering my blind spots.

567
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:51,840
- I like the vibe of Canada.
- Yes.

568
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:54,810
- It's nice, right?
- We're off to a nice start.

569
00:22:55,380 --> 00:22:57,780
There's not much in the city, right?

570
00:22:57,780 --> 00:22:59,080
- Right.
- I really like that.

571
00:22:59,580 --> 00:23:00,650
There are no landmarks...

572
00:23:00,650 --> 00:23:02,750
or places you must visit.

573
00:23:02,750 --> 00:23:03,790
Right.

574
00:23:04,050 --> 00:23:05,360
People just live here.

575
00:23:07,320 --> 00:23:10,530
(You can see a slice of daily life wherever you go.)

576
00:23:10,690 --> 00:23:14,260
(I live here too!)

577
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:18,940
So where are we going?

578
00:23:18,940 --> 00:23:20,100
Yesterday,

579
00:23:20,100 --> 00:23:22,310
- I asked the waitress.
- Right.

580
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:24,210
I asked where we should eat tomorrow,

581
00:23:24,210 --> 00:23:25,540
and she said this place.

582
00:23:25,840 --> 00:23:27,540
Are there any places...

583
00:23:27,540 --> 00:23:30,110
