601
00:24:07,380 --> 00:24:08,950
(Oh, you're so cool.)

602
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:12,760
Oh, this place is so vast.

603
00:24:13,120 --> 00:24:14,660
I like it. I love this vibe.

604
00:24:14,660 --> 00:24:16,630
