612
00:24:39,020 --> 00:24:40,420
Pretty easy, right?

613
00:24:41,420 --> 00:24:42,950
- Oh, zone number.
- Enter zone number.

614
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:45,060
Zone number.

615
00:24:45,390 --> 00:24:46,760
(Oh, it's back here.)

616
00:24:46,760 --> 00:24:47,820
It's back here.

617
00:24:49,660 --> 00:24:52,300
- You should leave the bag...
- Right. It must be heavy.

618
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:55,330
This place is very old-fashioned.

619
00:24:55,470 --> 00:24:56,670
