626
00:25:11,620 --> 00:25:13,750
Oh, zone number is referring to "zone."

627
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:15,650
Zone. The number of our spot.

628
00:25:15,890 --> 00:25:16,990
I was not thinking at all.

629
00:25:17,150 --> 00:25:19,260
(While Joon is confused, Ju Bin runs over.)

630
00:25:19,390 --> 00:25:20,460
This must be it, right?

631
00:25:21,260 --> 00:25:22,330
Is it 4722?

632
00:25:22,790 --> 00:25:23,860
Is it 4722?

633
00:25:25,260 --> 00:25:27,230
- Did you see it?
- It's 472...

634
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:29,100
- What did she say?
- It's 4277.

635
00:25:29,700 --> 00:25:30,900
It's 4711?

636
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:33,740
It's 47... It's 4277!

637
00:25:33,740 --> 00:25:34,800
What?

638
00:25:34,800 --> 00:25:36,240
It's 4277.

639
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:38,070
What is 4277? Is that the zone number?

640
00:25:38,280 --> 00:25:39,710
- I think so.
- It's 4277.

641
00:25:40,110 --> 00:25:42,410
- The zone number.
- It's 4277.

642
00:25:43,250 --> 00:25:44,950
- It worked.
- Oh, goodness.

643
00:25:45,220 --> 00:25:46,420
One dollar per hour?

644
