How much is that in Korean won?

645
00:25:48,050 --> 00:25:49,190
- Like 1,000 won?
- Like 900 won.

646
00:25:49,190 --> 00:25:50,790
Let's use lots of quarters.

647
00:25:52,120 --> 00:25:53,860
One, two...

648
00:25:53,890 --> 00:25:55,590
(Parking fee paid)

649
00:25:55,590 --> 00:25:57,590
Sometimes analogue is better.

650
00:25:57,590 --> 00:25:58,600
(Parking fee paid)

651
00:25:59,330 --> 00:26:01,400
This neighbourhood is so nice.

652
00:26:03,170 --> 00:26:04,630
I really want to live here...

653
00:26:04,700 --> 00:26:06,670
