I guess it's really popular.

664
00:26:29,130 --> 00:26:30,360
Excuse me.

665
00:26:30,630 --> 00:26:32,460
Is this the line for waiting?

666
00:26:32,460 --> 00:26:35,100
Yes. Just talk to the guys there.

667
00:26:35,100 --> 00:26:37,300
You can talk to him and he'll let you in.

668
00:26:37,970 --> 00:26:40,440
So this is a really old building, right?

669
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:41,810
I can see it like this.

670
00:26:41,810 --> 00:26:43,040
It was built in 1912.

671
00:26:43,440 --> 00:26:45,980
(A building built in 1912)

672
00:26:46,610 --> 00:26:48,140
Aren't such signs so pretty?

673
00:26:48,140 --> 00:26:49,250
It is.

674
00:26:49,250 --> 00:26:52,550
It feels like a diner you'd see in an American movie.

675
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:02,730
There's a table for you.

676
00:27:03,490 --> 00:27:04,560
We didn't have to wait so long.

677
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:08,370
It's so nice. The local vibe.

678
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:10,900
It's got a great vibe here.

679
00:27:12,900 --> 00:27:15,570
