682
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:27,020
Good morning. My name is Brad Myhre.

683
00:27:27,020 --> 00:27:30,520
I'm the owner of the diner.

684
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:33,060
And this one is modelled after...

685
00:27:33,060 --> 00:27:35,490
