686
00:27:36,090 --> 00:27:39,230
They are sort of modelled after the railway cars.

687
00:27:40,530 --> 00:27:44,130
So the diners were built in a long narrow fashion because...

688
00:27:44,470 --> 00:27:47,570
at one time you could actually order a diner...

689
00:27:47,940 --> 00:27:49,470
completely built...

690
00:27:49,910 --> 00:27:53,380
and finished with dishes and menus and everything in it...

691
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:57,310
and they would ship it on the railway, on a train car.

692
00:27:57,950 --> 00:28:02,020
So that's why it has the same dimensions as a railway train car.

693
00:28:02,890 --> 00:28:05,960
