701
00:28:26,210 --> 00:28:27,380
Good.

702
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,810
Have you been here before?

703
00:28:28,980 --> 00:28:30,410
No. It's our first time here.

704
00:28:30,410 --> 00:28:31,650
Welcome.

705
00:28:31,650 --> 00:28:33,620
