- Sourdough is my favourite.

723
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:12,660
Okay.

724
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:14,590
Would you like anything to drink?

725
00:29:14,820 --> 00:29:16,230
Coconut...

726
00:29:16,230 --> 00:29:17,630
- Coconut milkshake?
- Coconut milkshake.

727
00:29:17,630 --> 00:29:18,760
Hot coffee.

728
00:29:18,760 --> 00:29:20,130
- Hot coffee.
- Hot coffee.

729
00:29:20,130 --> 00:29:22,200
- Iced coffee.
- Iced coffee.

730
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:24,130
- One hot coffee, one iced coffee.
- Okay.

731
00:29:24,130 --> 00:29:25,140
Thank you.

732
00:29:25,140 --> 00:29:26,770
- Thank you.
- No worries.

733
00:29:27,140 --> 00:29:28,270
Look at this.

734
00:29:28,270 --> 00:29:30,310
- It's been used for ages.
- Right.

735
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:32,740
- I really love it.
- Me too. It's classic.

736
00:29:32,740 --> 00:29:33,840
It's classic.

737
00:29:33,840 --> 00:29:35,510
- Your beverages are here.
- Okay.

738
00:29:35,510 --> 00:29:37,280
- Coconut milkshake.
- Thank you.

739
00:29:37,710 --> 00:29:39,280
- Hot coffee.
- Yes.

740
00:29:39,750 --> 00:29:41,080
- Iced coffee.
- Thank you.

741
00:29:41,080 --> 00:29:43,250
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

742
00:29:43,250 --> 00:29:46,220
(Hyun Moo goes straight to getting his caffeine fix.)

743
00:29:47,120 --> 00:29:49,160
This is nice.

744
00:29:49,460 --> 00:29:50,760
Iced coffee is the best for Koreans.

745
00:29:50,860 --> 00:29:52,030
This is amazing.

746
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:54,430
- Coffee.
- It looks so nice. I'm curious.

747
00:29:56,900 --> 00:29:59,370
