1604
01:09:18,530 --> 01:09:22,160
From here, we're going to slap our heels.

1605
01:09:22,330 --> 01:09:24,570
Five, six, seven, and...

1606
01:09:25,270 --> 01:09:27,840
Right, left, left,

1607
01:09:28,300 --> 01:09:30,940
