1608
01:09:31,370 --> 01:09:32,610
Step and slap.

1609
01:09:32,610 --> 01:09:35,110
- Seven and one, two, three, four.
- Dance like this.

1610
01:09:35,110 --> 01:09:36,910
- This way, then that way.
- Five, six, seven, eight.

1611
01:09:36,910 --> 01:09:38,680
- One, two, three, four.
- Like this.

1612
01:09:38,680 --> 01:09:40,410
Five, six, seven.

1613
01:09:40,580 --> 01:09:41,920
- Okay.
- Okay.

1614
01:09:41,920 --> 01:09:43,780
One, two, three, four,

1615
01:09:43,780 --> 01:09:45,190
one, two, three, four.

1616
01:09:45,520 --> 01:09:47,620
