1619
01:09:53,430 --> 01:09:56,460
Left, hip, pivot, turn, stomp, stomp.

1620
01:09:56,960 --> 01:09:58,970
Here we go, five, six.

1621
01:09:59,200 --> 01:10:00,830
Five, six, seven, eight.

1622
