- I'm not following at all.

1645
01:11:14,710 --> 01:11:15,940
It's too hard!

1646
01:11:15,940 --> 01:11:17,610
- I'm not following at all.
- What do we do?

1647
01:11:17,610 --> 01:11:19,280
- I'm not following at all.
- It's so hard.

1648
01:11:19,450 --> 01:11:21,450
- How can a MBLAQ member struggle?
- It's hard.

1649
01:11:21,480 --> 01:11:22,580
Three, four,

1650
01:11:22,580 --> 01:11:25,690
